      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "content-tutorial-draft",
          "nodeId": "content-tutorial-draft-try"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Try it\n\n1. Switch to **edit mode** (the pencil).\n2. Press **Add node** and choose **Content**. A card appears.\n3. Select the card and press **Edit**, or double-click it. The card turns into an editor, with a toolbar when the kind is markdown.\n4. Type something. The card follows as you type.\n5. Change the **kind** from the menu, say to svg or json, and watch the same text show up differently.\n6. Press **Done** or **Esc** to put the card back. Clicking elsewhere does the same.\n7. Add a second face, point it at the same Content, and edit once. Both faces change."
        }
      }
    },
