        "identity": {
          "graphId": "content-tutorial-draft",
          "nodeId": "content-tutorial-draft-ports"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Ports\n\nA Content node has four ports: **in** on top, **out** below, and **prev** and **next** at the sides, which chain Content nodes into a sequence.\n\nA face reaches its Content through a `surface-delegate` relationship. Content does not own the face chain."
        }
      }
    },
